{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18103670","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18103670","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1810367001:1":{"text":"Tephesia.","source_cn":"苔佩希。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21ECC5424A0423A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810367002:1":{"text":"Wow... to what do I owe this honor? Shouldn't you be at King Thoran's side, serving as <style=\"highlight\">his most loyal Imperial Guard Commander</style>?","source_cn":"哦……瞧瞧，是哪阵阴风把<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BA9C9533B33AEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810367003:1":{"text":"And where's that adorable little horse of yours? I'm surprised you actually left it outside. Afraid it might crack the theater steps under its weight?","source_cn":"你那匹走到哪都要骑着的可爱马驹呢？为何不带进来，是怕它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x266DF251E5262B13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810367004:1":{"text":"Speaking like that only makes you look like a clown.","source_cn":"如果你不准备到台上扮小丑，就别用那种口气和我说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729C9F0A5816E5A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810367005:0":{"text":"Loosen up, <style=\"highlight\">Grezhul</style>. Even if King Thoran ordered the theater to be turned into a circus, I'd spare your little horse from the stage.","source_cn":"别担心，不苟言笑的<style=highlight>格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x796B4D94EA383713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810367006:1":{"text":"So, what exactly brings you here?","source_cn":"所以，拜见余是为了何事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE14977FD58E53C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810367007:1":{"text":"When will the <style=\"highlight\">Soul Forge</style> be ready for use? His Majesty wants an update.","source_cn":"陛下要知道<style=highlight>亡灵转化器...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF19BE2DD04270725","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810367008:1":{"text":"This is the eighty-seventh time His Majesty has asked about it. Hasn't he grown tired of asking by now?","source_cn":"陛下已经派人来问过八十七次了，还没问够吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3895CAF9B8120AAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810367009:1":{"text":"Answer me.","source_cn":"回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F486829A8D8F753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810367010:1":{"text":"As I've said countless times before, the construction was completed long ago, but the Soul Forge cannot be activated without the item I previously mentioned to His Majesty.","source_cn":"余的回答和之前相同：建造工作早已完成，但启动它需要余曾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66017ECEAB4C6E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810367011:1":{"text":"His Majesty has agreed to provide you with the item you require.","source_cn":"陛下已经许诺，给你提供启动装置所需的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE0457A740CF309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810367012:1":{"text":"Oh, is that so? Where is it?","source_cn":"是吗？在哪？余怎么没有看见？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5E9DCB2BFA35E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810367013:1":{"text":"It's right in front of you.","source_cn":"就在你面前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1271B70DB38E5153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810367014:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810367015:1":{"text":"You're the <style=\"highlight\">\"soul of absolute loyalty\"</style>?","source_cn":"托安陛下许诺的，<style=highlight>“绝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38D5ADE12CE4EE10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810367016:1":{"text":"Hahahaha! His Majesty is sacrificing your soul for his own cause, and you're taking it so calmly?","source_cn":"哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈！他要永久征用你的灵魂，你就这么坦然接受了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE7A0C3E5CA01AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810367017:1":{"text":"It's because lazy, inferior souls like yours are unworthy of serving His Majesty.","source_cn":"堕怠低等的灵魂不配被陛下使用——比如你这蠢货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1C3C48E271F87BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810367018:1":{"text":"You now have everything you need. Activate the Soul Forge at once. His Majesty is running out of patience.","source_cn":"你要的东西已经齐备，立刻启动亡灵转化器，陛下已经不想再等了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9832B59C27308AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810367019:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810367020:1":{"text":"Tsk... No more slacking off for me, I guess.","source_cn":"好吧……看来余这懒惰之人，也不得不打起精神了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67C4245EDBBEB695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:神秘的亡灵":{"text":"Odd Graveborn","source":"神秘的亡灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:苔佩希":{"text":"Tephesia","source":"苔佩希","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格瑞泽尔勒":{"text":"Grezhul","source":"格瑞泽尔勒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":3}}